abstract: >-
  Instance generator, measurement harnesses and raw results for a comparative
  computational study of fourteen convex quadratic-programming solvers on two
  problem templates from a legged-robot control stack.
keywords:
  - quadratic programming
  - solver comparison
  - warm start
  - reproducible benchmarking
  - real-time optimization
